  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Commencement of development (Full Permission)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development to which\r\nthis permission relates shall be commenced not later than the expiration of 3\r\nyears from the date of this permission.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  To comply with Section 91\r\n(as amended) of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990.</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Approved Plans</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out\r\nin accordance with the following approved plans: [</span></span>SW20 9NP/Botr-2A1,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">SW20 9NP/Botr-2A5,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">SW20 9NP/Botr-2A9,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">SW20 9NP/Botr-2APRP]</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper\r\nplanning</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Matching Materials</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The facing materials used in the development hereby\r\npermitted shall match those of the existing building in materials, style,\r\ncolour, texture and, in the case of brickwork, bonding, coursing and pointing.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To ensure a satisfactory\r\nappearance of the development and to comply with policies D12.1 and D12.3 of\r\nthe Local Plan 2024.</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Obscured Glazing (Fixed Shut)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - Before the development hereby permitted\r\nis first occupied, the windows in the first floor side facing window in the south elevation shall be glazed with\r\nobscure glass and fixed shut and shall permanently maintained as such\r\nthereafter.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:&nbsp; To safeguard the\r\namenities and privacy of the occupiers of adjoining properties and to comply\r\nwith the following Development Plan policies for Merton: policies D3 and D4 of\r\nthe London Plan 2021 and policies D12.3 &amp; D12.4</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\" aptos\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:=\"\" en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\" arial\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:=\"\" en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">of the Local Plan\r\n2024.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>",
    "The development hereby approved shall implement the fire safety measures as submitted with the proposal titled: Fire Safety Strategy. These measures shall thereafter be retained in perpetuity Reason:&nbsp;To ensure that the development complies with policy D12 of the London Plan 2021"
  ],
